.TH L123 1 "2026-05-03" "l123 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l123 \- terminal clone of Lotus 1\-2\-3 Release 3.4a for DOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l123
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ FILE ]
.br
.B l123 config
.RI [ --init " [" --force ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l123
is a TUI spreadsheet that recreates the look and feel of Lotus 1\-2\-3
Release 3.4a for DOS, backed by the IronCalc calculation engine. It
opens
.B .xlsx
workbooks.
.PP
With no
.IR FILE ,
.B l123
starts on an empty workbook.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " NAME"
Chrome theme:
.B default
or
.BR dos .
Overrides the
.B L123_THEME
environment variable and the
.B theme=
setting in
.BR L123.CNF .
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B config
Print the effective configuration and where each value came from.
.TP
.B config \-\-init
Write a sample
.B ~/.l123/L123.CNF
with annotated defaults.
.TP
.B config \-\-init \-\-force
Overwrite an existing
.B L123.CNF .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B L123_USER
Name shown on the startup splash.
.TP
.B L123_ORG
Organization shown on the startup splash.
.TP
.B L123_LOG
Path to a log file. When set, events are appended to this file; when
unset, no logging is performed.
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Standard
.B tracing
env filter (e.g.\&
.BR l123=debug ).
Defaults to
.B info
when
.B L123_LOG
is set.
.TP
.B L123_BEEP
Soft terminal bell on edge collisions
.RB ( true / false ).
Default:
.BR true .
.TP
.B L123_THEME
Chrome theme name
.RB ( default " | " dos ).
Overridden by
.BR \-\-theme ;
overrides
.B L123.CNF
.BR theme= .
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.l123/L123.CNF
Optional configuration file. Run
.B l123 config \-\-init
to create an annotated sample.
.SH KEYS
Inside the program:
.TP
.B /
Open the 1\-2\-3 slash menu.
.TP
.B F1
Help.
.TP
.B F10
Graph view.
.TP
.B /QY
Quit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime error.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (unknown option, bad argument).
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation:
.UR https://github.com/duane1024/l123
project page
.UE .
.SH AUTHOR
Duane Moore.
